# Machine: LEONARDO (CINECA)

I am running on a LEONARDO login node.

- Cluster: LEONARDO Booster (4x A100 64GB per node), CINECA
- Scheduler: SLURM — QoS, limits, and commands: see the `hpc-leonardo` plugin references
- Code lives in `$WORK/$USER/`, data in `$SCRATCH` (auto-purged after 40 days)
- SLURM logs: `$SCRATCH/slurm_logs/`
- Conda envs: <FILL IN: path + default env name>
- Account for sbatch: <FILL IN: -A account>
- Support: superc@cineca.it
